    "body": "### Describe the bug\n\n[example logs](https://github.com/yt-project/yt/actions/runs/29387926051/job/87264956322)\nThis is seen in CI against ubuntu + x86_64, and I can reproduce this locally using the latest nightlies `3.3.0a2.dev0` on MacOS ARM64\nSo far I haven't managed to reproduce the error with a locally compiled dev version.\n\n```\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Build/Dependencies.py\",\n      line 1267, in cythonize_one_helper\n          return cythonize_one(*m)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Build/Dependencies.py\",\n      line 1238, in cythonize_one\n          result = compile_single(pyx_file, options,\n      full_module_name=full_module_name, cache=cache, fingerprint=fingerprint)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\",\n      line 670, in compile_single\n          return run_pipeline(source, options, full_module_name, context)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\",\n      line 566, in run_pipeline\n          err, enddata = Pipeline.run_pipeline(pipeline, source)\n                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\",\n      line 418, in run_pipeline\n          data = run(phase, data)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\",\n      line 400, in run\n          return phase(data)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\",\n      line 50, in generate_pyx_code_stage\n          module_node.process_implementation(options, result)\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\",\n      line 314, in process_implementation\n          self.generate_c_code(env, options, result)\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\",\n      line 638, in generate_c_code\n          self.generate_module_init_func(\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^\n              modules[:-1], shared_utility_exporter, env,\n      globalstate['init_module']\n      \n      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n          )\n          ^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\",\n      line 3540, in generate_module_init_func\n          self.specialize_fused_types(module)\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\",\n      line 4146, in specialize_fused_types\n          entry.type.get_all_specialized_function_types()\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/yt/yt/.venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/PyrexTypes.py\",\n      line 3975, in get_all_specialized_function_types\n          fused_to_specific[arg.type] if arg.is_fused else arg\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^\n      KeyError: <CPtrType <CArrayType 3 FusedType(name='floating')>>\n      concurrent.futures.process._RemoteTraceback:\n      \"\"\"\n      KeyError: <CPtrType <CArrayType 3 FusedType(name='floating')>>\n\n      During handling of the above exception, another exception occurred:\n\n      Traceback (most recent call last):\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/_temp/uv-python-dir/cpython-3.14.6-linux-x86_64-gnu/lib/python3.14/concurrent/futures/process.py\",\n      line 210, in _sendback_result\n          result_queue.put(_ResultItem(work_id, result=result,\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n                                       exception=exception,\n      exit_pid=exit_pid))\n                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/_temp/uv-python-dir/cpython-3.14.6-linux-x86_64-gnu/lib/python3.14/multiprocessing/queues.py\",\n      line 391, in put\n          obj = _ForkingPickler.dumps(obj)\n        File\n      \"/home/runner/work/_temp/uv-python-dir/cpython-3.14.6-linux-x86_64-gnu/lib/python3.14/multiprocessing/reduction.py\",\n      line 51, in dumps\n          cls(buf, protocol).dump(obj)\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^\n      _pickle.PicklingError: Can't pickle local object <function\n      MemoryViewSliceType.create_from_py_utility_code.<locals>.lazy_utility_callback\n```\n\n### Code to reproduce the behaviour:\n\nI don't have time to minimize the reproducer just now, but hopefully I can do it in a couple days if need be.\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\n_No response_\n\n### OS\n\nat least Linux and macOS\n\n### Python version\n\n3.14.6\n\n### Cython version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_",
